WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
[Instrumental music: “Origami” by Scott Buckley]
Less switching. Keep what you need within reach.

00:03.200 --> 00:07.100
Drag. Park.
Your file stays ready.

00:07.100 --> 00:12.000
Pick up. Carry on.
A different window. The same file.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.500
Look up.
Right where you work.

00:14.500 --> 00:19.600
Stay in your flow.
Pause. Skip. Get back to it.

00:19.600 --> 00:22.800
A little clarity.
CPU. Memory. Network. And the apps using them.

00:22.800 --> 00:26.420
Power. Over time.
A live reading. A two-minute history.

00:26.420 --> 00:31.210
Find it again.
Search. Save. Copy. Kept on your Mac.

00:31.210 --> 00:33.210
More doing.

00:33.210 --> 00:39.500
OpenYoink. Your Mac. An extra hand.
Free and open source. macOS 15+.
